{
  "name": "works-everything",
  "title": "Everything",
  "base": "works-core",
  "extends": ["works-geoscience"],
  "description": "Every first-party Works package: the Geoscience profile plus Patchbay, the Hex viewer, Encode/Hash, the Book reader, Docs, and the WASM-4 console.",
  "packages": [
    "@gcu/patchbay",
    "@gcu/hex",
    "@gcu/encode",
    "@gcu/book",
    "@gcu/docs",
    "@gcu/wasm4",
    "@example/service"
  ],
  "settings": { "appearance": { "theme": "dark" } },
  "welcome": [
    { "kind": "notebook" },
    { "kind": "doc", "content": "# Welcome to Auditable Works — Everything\n\nEvery first-party Works package is installed — the full polyglot notebook (Python, Soft, plot, sadpan, SQL/GLSL/Calque), the geoscience tools (Data Workbench, Strata, Plate), and every surface: Document editor, Patchbay, Hex viewer, Encode/Hash, the Book reader, Docs, and the WASM-4 console.\n\nA quick tour:\n\n- **File → New ⟨language⟩ notebook** — start a Python (or Soft) notebook.\n- **Tools** — Data workbench, Patchbay, Terminal, Library, and more.\n- **Tools → Library** — install content packs + extra extensions (e.g. the DD-60 reader skin).\n- **Tools → Set up / change profile…** — re-provision or switch profiles any time.\n\nThe interactive tour notebook (a synthetic block model for the Data Workbench) is seeded too. Delete any of this whenever you're done." }
  ]
}
